  "prompt": "Deep indigo night palette overprinted with fluorescent hot pink and electric blue, warm cream highlights, a bright golden luminous band at the horizon or light source, highly saturated, deep rich shadows, strong contrast, layered clouds with clear foreground and background depth, playful slightly quirky cosmic mood, no people, no text, no letters, no logos.",
