   "id": "img_observatory",
   "kind": "image",
   "prompt": "A small white observatory dome on a grassy hill at night with its slit open toward the sky, the Milky Way blazing overhead in pink and blue, low cloud banks rolling in front of distant mountains, golden light band at the horizon."
  },
  {
   "id": "img_galaxy_edge",
   "kind": "image",
   "prompt": "The far edge of the universe: vast glowing nebula clouds in hot pink and electric blue, layered dust clouds in front and behind, a brilliant golden core of light in the distance, scattered stars, deep dark voids."
  },
