   "id": "img_rain_street",
   "kind": "image",
   "prompt": "A narrow shopping street on a rainy night, puddles reflecting saturated pink and blue shop lights, a lone vending machine glowing, rain streaks, low clouds lit from below by the city, deep shadows."
  },
  {
   "id": "img_sky_birds",
   "kind": "image",
